usage
=====

the 'git' service runs git-daemon as the 'git' user. the user and
/var/git are created on install. enable the service:

  ln -s /etc/sv/git /var/service

every repository under /var/git is exported (git://host/<repo>). the
base path and extra options can be changed in /etc/sv/git/conf:

  git_home=/srv/git
  git_opts="--port=9418"

repositories must be readable by the 'git' user.
